{"seq":2,"slug":"breakpoints-and-stepping","title":"断点与单步执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/breakpoints-and-stepping","wordCount":1104,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"断点与单步执行\">断点与单步执行</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>断点与单步是调试中最基础的两个动作：<strong>断点决定在哪里停，单步决定停下来之后怎么走</strong>。二者围绕同一个循环展开——程序暂停（stopped 事件）→ 用户下达执行控制命令 → 程序继续运行 → 再次暂停。理解本主题的关键是先分清断点的多种「定位方式」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断点类型</th>\n<th>定位依据</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码断点</td>\n<td>文件 + 行号</td>\n<td>执行到该行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数断点</td>\n<td>函数名</td>\n<td>调用该函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据断点</td>\n<td>变量/地址</td>\n<td>值发生变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常断点</td>\n<td>异常类型</td>\n<td>抛出异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令断点</td>\n<td>内存地址</td>\n<td>执行到该指令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个容易踩坑的细节是：请求的行号未必等于实际生效的行号，服务端返回的 <code>verified</code> 状态和实际位置才是权威。</p>\n<h2 id=\"源码断点\">源码断点</h2><p>源码断点（Source Breakpoint）是最常用的断点类型，通过文件路径和行号定位暂停位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SetBreakpointsArguments {&#10;  source: Source;&#10;  breakpoints?: SourceBreakpoint[];&#10;  lines?: number[];&#10;  sourceModified?: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SourceBreakpoint {&#10;  line: number;&#10;  column?: number;&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;  hitCondition?: string;&#10;  logMessage?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Breakpoint {&#10;  id?: number;&#10;  verified: boolean;&#10;  message?: string;&#10;  source?: Source;&#10;  line?: number;&#10;  column?: number;&#10;  endLine?: number;&#10;  endColumn?: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetBreakpointsArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sourceModified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  logMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Breakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  verified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  endColumn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;    participant RT as 运行时&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints (source, breakpoints)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: 设置原生断点&#10;    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: 实际断点位置(可能有偏移)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Breakpoint[] (verified, actual line)&#10;    Note left of E: 红色圆点显示在实际行&#10;    RT-&gt;&gt;DA: 命中断点&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (reason: &quot;breakpoint&quot;)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n    participant RT as 运行时\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: setBreakpoints (source, breakpoints)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;RT: 设置原生断点\n    RT--&gt;&gt;DA: 实际断点位置(可能有偏移)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Breakpoint[] (verified, actual line)\n    Note left of E: 红色圆点显示在实际行\n    RT-&gt;&gt;DA: 命中断点\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped event (reason: \"breakpoint\")</pre><p>断点验证状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>verified</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>编辑器显示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>true</td>\n<td>断点已成功设置在目标位置</td>\n<td>实心红色圆点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>断点无法设置（如空行、优化代码）</td>\n<td>灰色空心圆点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 设置断点时服务端返回的行号可能与请求的行号不同。例如请求在空行设置断点，运行时会自动调整到最近的可执行行。编辑器应按返回的实际位置显示断点。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"函数断点与数据断点\">函数断点与数据断点</h2><p>除源码断点外，DAP 还支持函数断点（按函数名暂停）和数据断点（按变量值变化暂停）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SetFunctionBreakpointsArguments {&#10;  breakpoints: FunctionBreakpoint[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FunctionBreakpoint {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;  hitCondition?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DataBreakpointInfoArguments {&#10;  variablesReference: number;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  frameId?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SetDataBreakpointsArguments {&#10;  breakpoints: DataBreakpoint[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DataBreakpoint {&#10;  dataId: string;&#10;  accessType?: &#39;read&#39; | &#39;write&#39; | &#39;readWrite&#39;;&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;  hitCondition?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetFunctionBreakpointsArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunctionBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunctionBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataBreakpointInfoArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variablesReference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  frameId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetDataBreakpointsArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dataId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  accessType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'read'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'write'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'readWrite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各类断点对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断点类型</th>\n<th>定位方式</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码断点</td>\n<td>文件 + 行号</td>\n<td>执行到该行</td>\n<td>常规调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数断点</td>\n<td>函数名</td>\n<td>调用该函数</td>\n<td>无源码时、动态调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据断点</td>\n<td>变量/地址</td>\n<td>值发生变化</td>\n<td>追踪状态变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常断点</td>\n<td>异常类型</td>\n<td>抛出异常</td>\n<td>错误排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令断点</td>\n<td>内存地址</td>\n<td>执行到该指令</td>\n<td>底层调试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BP[断点类型] --&gt; SOURCE[源码断点]&#10;    BP --&gt; FUNC[函数断点]&#10;    BP --&gt; DATA[数据断点]&#10;    BP --&gt; EXCEPTION[异常断点]&#10;    BP --&gt; INSTRUCTION[指令断点]&#10;&#10;    SOURCE --&gt; S1[&quot;main.ts:25&quot;]&#10;    FUNC --&gt; F1[&quot;handleRequest&quot;]&#10;    DATA --&gt; D1[&quot;user.name 写入时&quot;]&#10;    EXCEPTION --&gt; E1[&quot;TypeError 抛出时&quot;]&#10;    INSTRUCTION --&gt; I1[&quot;0x7fff5fbff8c0&quot;]\">graph TD\n    BP[断点类型] --&gt; SOURCE[源码断点]\n    BP --&gt; FUNC[函数断点]\n    BP --&gt; DATA[数据断点]\n    BP --&gt; EXCEPTION[异常断点]\n    BP --&gt; INSTRUCTION[指令断点]\n\n    SOURCE --&gt; S1[\"main.ts:25\"]\n    FUNC --&gt; F1[\"handleRequest\"]\n    DATA --&gt; D1[\"user.name 写入时\"]\n    EXCEPTION --&gt; E1[\"TypeError 抛出时\"]\n    INSTRUCTION --&gt; I1[\"0x7fff5fbff8c0\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"异常断点\">异常断点</h2><p>异常断点在特定类型的异常抛出时暂停执行，是排查运行时错误的重要手段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SetExceptionBreakpointsArguments {&#10;  filters: string[];&#10;  filterOptions?: ExceptionFilterOptions[];&#10;  exceptionOptions?: ExceptionOptions[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ExceptionFilterOptions {&#10;  filterId: string;&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ExceptionBreakpointsFilter {&#10;  filter: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  description?: string;&#10;  default?: boolean;&#10;  supportsCondition?: boolean;&#10;  conditionDescription?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetExceptionBreakpointsArguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filterOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExceptionFilterOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  exceptionOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExceptionOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExceptionFilterOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filterId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExceptionBreakpointsFilter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"col