ark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threadId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  singleThread</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  granularity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SteppingGranularity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SteppingGranularity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'statement'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'line'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'instruction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PAUSED[程序暂停] --&gt; CONTINUE[&quot;Continue (F5)&quot;]&#10;    PAUSED --&gt; NEXT[&quot;Step Over (F10)&quot;]&#10;    PAUSED --&gt; STEPIN[&quot;Step Into (F11)&quot;]&#10;    PAUSED --&gt; STEPOUT[&quot;Step Out (Shift+F11)&quot;]&#10;    PAUSED --&gt; RESTART[&quot;Restart Frame&quot;]&#10;&#10;    CONTINUE --&gt; RUN[继续运行到下一个断点]&#10;    NEXT --&gt; NEXTLINE[执行当前行,跳过函数调用]&#10;    STEPIN --&gt; ENTER[进入函数内部]&#10;    STEPOUT --&gt; EXIT[执行完当前函数,返回调用者]&#10;    RESTART --&gt; REWIND[重新执行当前栈帧]\">graph TD\n    PAUSED[程序暂停] --&gt; CONTINUE[\"Continue (F5)\"]\n    PAUSED --&gt; NEXT[\"Step Over (F10)\"]\n    PAUSED --&gt; STEPIN[\"Step Into (F11)\"]\n    PAUSED --&gt; STEPOUT[\"Step Out (Shift+F11)\"]\n    PAUSED --&gt; RESTART[\"Restart Frame\"]\n\n    CONTINUE --&gt; RUN[继续运行到下一个断点]\n    NEXT --&gt; NEXTLINE[执行当前行,跳过函数调用]\n    STEPIN --&gt; ENTER[进入函数内部]\n    STEPOUT --&gt; EXIT[执行完当前函数,返回调用者]\n    RESTART --&gt; REWIND[重新执行当前栈帧]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>DAP 请求</th>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Continue</td>\n<td>continue</td>\n<td>F5</td>\n<td>继续运行直到下一个断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step Over</td>\n<td>next</td>\n<td>F10</td>\n<td>执行当前行，跳过函数调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step Into</td>\n<td>stepIn</td>\n<td>F11</td>\n<td>进入函数调用内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step Out</td>\n<td>stepOut</td>\n<td>Shift+F11</td>\n<td>执行完当前函数并返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pause</td>\n<td>pause</td>\n<td>F6</td>\n<td>暂停运行中的程序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Restart</td>\n<td>restart</td>\n<td>Ctrl+Shift+F5</td>\n<td>重新开始调试会话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"stopped-事件\">Stopped 事件</h2><p>当程序暂停时，适配器发送 <code>stopped</code> 事件通知编辑器暂停原因。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StoppedEvent {&#10;  reason: string;&#10;  description?: string;&#10;  threadId?: number;&#10;  preserveFocusHint?: boolean;&#10;  text?: string;&#10;  allThreadsStopped?: boolean;&#10;  hitBreakpointIds?: number[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StoppedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threadId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  preserveFocusHint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  allThreadsStopped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitBreakpointIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>reason</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>后续操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>breakpoint</td>\n<td>命中断点</td>\n<td>编辑器高亮断点行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>step</td>\n<td>单步执行完成</td>\n<td>编辑器高亮当前行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>exception</td>\n<td>异常抛出</td>\n<td>编辑器显示异常信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pause</td>\n<td>用户手动暂停</td>\n<td>编辑器显示当前执行位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>entry</td>\n<td>程序入口点</td>\n<td>stopOnEntry 配置启用时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>goto</td>\n<td>执行到目标位置</td>\n<td>goto target 请求触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dataBreakpoint</td>\n<td>数据断点触发</td>\n<td>编辑器高亮变量变更位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: &quot;breakpoint&quot;, threadId: 1)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace (threadId: 1)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: StackFrame[]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: scopes (frameId: 0)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Scope[]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 1)&#10;    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[]&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 更新调用栈、变量面板\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n    participant E as 编辑器\n\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: \"breakpoint\", threadId: 1)\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stackTrace (threadId: 1)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: StackFrame[]\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: scopes (frameId: 0)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Scope[]\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: variables (variablesReference: 1)\n    DA--&gt;&gt;E: Variable[]\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 更新调用栈、变量面板</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>allThreadsStopped</code> 表示所有线程都已暂停（全停模式），部分调试器支持仅暂停触发断点的线程而其他线程继续执行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((断点与单步执行))&#10;    断点类型&#10;      源码断点 行号定位&#10;      函数断点 函数名触发&#10;      数据断点 值变化触发&#10;      异常断点 异常过滤&#10;      指令断点 地址级别&#10;    断点验证&#10;      verified 确认设置&#10;      行号偏移调整&#10;      灰色表示无效&#10;    执行控制&#10;      Continue 继续&#10;      Step Over 跳过&#10;      Step Into 进入&#10;      Step Out 返回&#10;    Stopped 事件&#10;      暂停原因分类&#10;      线程标识&#10;      全停/部分停模式&#10;    步进粒度&#10;      statement 语句&#10;      line 行&#10;      instruction 指令\">mindmap\n  root((断点与单步执行))\n    断点类型\n      源码断点 行号定位\n      函数断点 函数名触发\n      数据断点 值变化触发\n      异常断点 异常过滤\n      指令断点 地址级别\n    断点验证\n      verified 确认设置\n      行号偏移调整\n      灰色表示无效\n    执行控制\n      Continue 继续\n      Step Over 跳过\n      Step Into 进入\n      Step Out 返回\n    Stopped 事件\n      暂停原因分类\n      线程标识\n      全停/部分停模式\n    步进粒度\n      statement 语句\n      line 行\n      instruction 指令</pre><ul>\n<li>DAP 支持<strong>源码断点、函数断点、数据断点、异常断点和指令断点</strong>五种断点类型。</li>\n<li>断点设置后服务端返回 <code>verified</code> 状态和<strong>实际行号</strong>，编辑器应按实际位置显示。</li>\n<li><strong>执行控制</strong>包括 Continue/Step Over/Step Into/Step Out/Pause 五种基本操作。</li>\n<li><strong>Stopped 事件</strong>通过 <code>reason</code> 字段告知编辑器暂停原因，触发调用栈和变量面板的自动更新。</li>\n<li>步进粒度支持 statement（语句）、line（行）和 instruction（指令）三种级别。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"断点与单步执行","id":"断点与单步执行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"源码断点","id":"源码断点"},{"level":2,"text":"函数断点与数据断点","id":"函数断点与数据断点"},{"level":2,"text":"异常断点","id":"异常断点"},{"level":2,"text":"执行控制","id":"执行控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Stopped 事件","id":"stopped-事件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DAP 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/dap-architecture"},"next":{"title":"变量检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/variable-inspection"}}